contentText:
In 2020, Sara Schell was planning to move to London to study business after graduating high school in Venezuela. This Thursday (Nov. 12), she is competing for the Latin Grammy Award for songwriter of the year, as well as best pop song as a co-writer of Kany García&#8217;s &#8220;A La Niña Que Fui.&#8221;

Related

